OL,3,GNEWSANew #19.7m health academy gets
OL,4,A'bat cave' approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on a new health and social care
OL,7,Ftraining academy could begin before the
OL,8,Fend of the year, after essential bat
OL,9,Fmitigation work was approved by
OL,10,Fcouncillors.
OL,12,FAbout #19.7m of funding was awarded as
OL,13,Fpart of the levelling up fund in
OL,14,FJanuary 2023, to create the new
OL,15,Ffacility at the former community
OL,16,Fhospital site on Salmon Parade in
OL,17,FBridgwater.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
