OL,3,GNEWSANew #19.7m health academy gets
OL,4,A'bat cave' approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, before it could be converted
OL,7,Fit needed "dedicated bat mitigation"
OL,8,Fworks, which will turn the gatehouse
OL,9,Fattic into a loft space for the winged
OL,10,Fmammals.
OL,12,FIt is hoped up to 3,000 training
OL,13,Fsessions will be delivered by the
OL,14,FSomerset NHS Foundation Trust through
OL,15,Fthe academy every year.
